WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.122
Thila e bateba. Ɗuum woni kaalankaagal lobbi.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.424
Ɗuum woni suukala Kambire, wuro go'o e cuuɗi mawɗi.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.610
Walaa ko waawata heɓugo mo. Ammaa non boo.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.450
Wakkati go'oto, ɓiɗɗo Kambiré nyawdi. Walaa kooɗume ɓeydaani mo.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.634
Sey haykaliiru wurti nder dammugal. Luttuɗum wari nder wuro.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.800
Kambiré yahi haa debbo mo o yi'i yeeso.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.400
Ɓiɗɗo am ɗon torra. Honooɓe e meeɗen ?

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.116
Eɗen ndaara ɗum.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:24.008
O wurtini ɓikkoy ɗi'i dow leydi, o ɗon ndaara ɗe haa wakkati seɗɗa.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.626
Ɗe woni tiila'en, ɓerɗe. Ɓe ɗon ɗaɓɓa ko'e mon.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.608
Nder jemma maajum Kambiré waɗi lekki.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.960
Ɓe ngi'i mo laamiiɗo, ɓe holliimo haykaliiru.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.804
Fuli ɗum. Ndaa ɗum nder wuro maaɗa. O ɗon hakkilana.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.864
Nde Kambiré ummii, o anndi ko o waɗata.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.992
O suɓii go'o, o fuɗɗii saɗugo.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.920
Ɗe'ere, nden boo ɗiɗaɓere.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.810
Ɗo'on woni bateba'en: kuuje mawɗe.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:09.920
O wurtini ɗi dow maagal ngal haa dammugal suudu Allah, o hokki ɗum sadaka.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.288
Yimɓe wuro maɓɓe mbi'i ɓe, bana yimɓe saare boo mbi'a.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.032
Nde jemma waɗi, weelo wari.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:50.498
O ɓaditi haa maagoore, nden bateba'en ummii. Ɗuum waɗi jayngol dow maɓɓe.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.096
Nyokki on dilli, o yahi.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:21.162
Nde subaka, ɓiɗɗo on ɗon njulaago nder suudu. Gila ndeen, yimɓe Lobi mbiyi bateba'en ɗon ɗowtana wuro.
